# Indexes a library whose root folder holds the folders Flat-1k, Flat-5k, Flat-20k and Flat-100k: the folder tree, then
# every folder with its thumbnails. The events folder_index_us in the log are the times of scan plus thumbnail generation.
ready
tree
view grid
folder Flat-1k index
folder Flat-5k index
folder Flat-20k index
folder Flat-100k index
settle 2000
quit
